[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12902.15, "timestamp": "03:35:02", "text": "所以我向那位女士解释了这件事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12905.03, "timestamp": "03:35:05", "text": "在电话里，我说，是啊，所以才这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12908.309, "timestamp": "03:35:08", "text": "我自己按了“是”，所以他们就说“好的，呃”。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12909.99, "timestamp": "03:35:09", "text": "我们会想办法解决这个问题的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12912.63, "timestamp": "03:35:12", "text": "别担心，我问出了我的疑问。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12915.99, "timestamp": "03:35:15", "text": "注意到政策页面是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12918.55, "timestamp": "03:35:18", "text": "赛车手的报酬由我提供"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12920.71, "timestamp": "03:35:20", "text": "信息和地址之类的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12923.269, "timestamp": "03:35:23", "text": "地点等等。如果我是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12925.83, "timestamp": "03:35:25", "text": "我自己制定政策之类的，是吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12930.15, "timestamp": "03:35:30", "text": "如果我不包含地点信息，也可以。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12932.469, "timestamp": "03:35:32", "text": "呃，我公司所在的位置，比如"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12934.229, "timestamp": "03:35:34", "text": "具体细节和电话号码。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12936.469, "timestamp": "03:35:36", "text": "他们说这是必须的。我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12939.269, "timestamp": "03:35:39", "text": "比如……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12942.229, "timestamp": "03:35:42", "text": "然后我去了Incandax办公室。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12946.15, "timestamp": "03:35:46", "text": "我家附近有什么事？校长问道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12949.349, "timestamp": "03:35:49", "text": "女校长就像……呃，所以我的这个是我的这个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12952.07, "timestamp": "03:35:52", "text": "问题是，他们这样可以吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12954.15, "timestamp": "03:35:54", "text": "当我需要帮忙搬东西的时候"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 12956.549, "timestamp": "03:35:56", "author": "@mattmeownster", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_k0PVo4Ayjzf9FlRcdjZAQYBwK430_hLvWlP9jgikQjC65W-ONDWjkk4dykteuHJ96HgQ=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "yea"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12956.79, "timestamp": "03:35:56", "text": "最初是去向他们寻求帮助的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12959.51, "timestamp": "03:35:59", "text": "我父母当时就说，是啊。"}]